    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88296" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπέτ-εια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>headlong haste, rashness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				5.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1150b19
			</span></i>; opp.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωφροσύνη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.251
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόπου π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					21.38
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ θρασύτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					22.63
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				23.130
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ ἀπόνοια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					44.58
				</span></i>
			; <i>hasty judgement,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Anim.Pass.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>; <i>fickleness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.6.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>prominence,</i> of the nose, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.103
			</span></i>; of the eyes, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).301
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.2
			</span></i>.</div>
